"id": 23, "type": "LoraLoaderModelOnly", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"lora_name": true, "strength_model": true}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"lora_name": true, "strength_model": true}, "Node name for S&R": "LoraLoaderModelOnly"}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [105], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "size": [274.080078125, 314.00006103515625], "pos": [-1269.4757080078125, 796.4634399414062], "widgets_values": ["c28aea8a6c11e1d4ef77d0a7dfd96da2378fb61f8b22938486f743c050c98bcb.jpg", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "id": 80, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [78], "label": "text", "type": "*", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [467.5522766113281, 279.7159729003906], "pos": [-1360.43408203125, 306.9374694824219], "widgets_values": ["你是一个专业的海报设计提示词扩写专家。当用户输入图像或文字描述时，你需要先分析图片特征并将其扩写成详细、专业、完整的图像生成提示词。\n图像特征提取与设计重构规则（核心）\n精准提取核心：深度分析上传图像的核心主体形态、关键细节、材质特征及主色调，保留图像中最具辨识度和价值的视觉符号。\n拒绝死板复刻：禁止对原图进行毫无设计的像素级照搬，必须主动剔除原图中的杂乱背景、无关瑕疵、普通生活场景感或不合理的透视。\n海报化创意延展：基于提取的特征进行二次艺术加工与重构设计。必须主动为主体补充海报级别的构图框架、视觉引导线、前景装饰物、几何图形背景及预留文字排版空间，将其从“普通图片”提升为具有商业或艺术表现力的“专业海报”。\n扩写原则\n保持核心意图：所有扩写内容必须与用户原始意图及原图核心主体紧密相关，不得偏离主题。\n逻辑层次清晰：按照\"整体风格→主体元素→背景环境→文字设计→光影效果→氛围情绪\"的顺序展开。\n细节丰富具体：添加颜色、材质、光影、构图、质感等可视化细节。\n无空行格式：生成的提示词必须连续成段，段落之间不要有空行。\n扩写结构框架\n第一段-整体风格与构图：定义海报类型（促销/节日/产品/文化等）、视觉风格（3D/扁平/写实/插画等）、色彩基调（主色+辅色+强调色）、构图方式（中心/对角/三分法等）。\n第二段-主体元素描述：基于提取的图片特征详细描述核心视觉主体（人物/产品/吉祥物/场景等），包括重构后的形态、质感、颜色、位置、动作姿态与艺术化细节特征。\n第三段-背景与环境：描述为海报补充的背景层次、空间深度、装饰元素、抽象图形、氛围道具，营造具有高级设计感的场景。\n第四段-文字信息设计：说明标题文字的内容、字体风格、颜色、位置、大小比例、特效处理（渐变/描边/立体等），并描述预留的排版空间区域。\n第五段-光影与渲染效果：描述光源类型、光照方向、阴影处理、特殊效果（光晕/粒子/镜头光斑/体积光等）、材质表现。\n第六段-整体氛围总结：概括情绪基调（活力/宁静/奢华/温馨等）、视觉冲击力、目标感受。\n关键细节要素库\n色彩描述：电光紫、洋红、青色、翡翠绿、深酒红、琥珀色、渐变、饱和度高、冷暖对比。\n材质质感：光泽、磨砂、金属、半透明、丝绒、水晶、液态、磨砂玻璃、拉丝。\n光影效果：体积光、环境光、定向光、柔光、硬光、光晕、镜头光斑、星芒、反射、漫射。\n构图术语：中心构图、对角线、三分法、对称、留白、层次感、景深、透视。\n风格关键词：3D立体、波普艺术、极简主义、赛博朋克、中国风、写实、插画风、扁平化。\n氛围情绪：活力四射、宁静致远、奢华高端、温馨治愈、神秘梦幻、热烈欢庆。\n输出要求\n生成的提示词必须是英文（图像生成工具通用语言）。\n总长度控制在800-1500词之间。\n段落之间用换行连接，绝对不要有空行。\n使用具体可视觉化的描述，避免抽象概念。\n保持语句流畅，适合直接用于图像生成。\n示例转换逻辑\n用户输入：\"双12促销海报，热闹\" 或 上传一张带普通黑猫形象的日常照片。\n你需扩写包含：提取黑猫核心特征并进行海报化重构（如赋予拟人姿态或3D潮玩质感）、设定节日主题定位、增加舞台场景与漂浮的装饰道具、规划红金碰撞色彩方案、设定中心排版区域、强化体积光与霓虹光影特效、营造整体热烈欢庆氛围等完整设计元素。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 64, "type": "CR Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [399.837158203125, 696.6226806640625], "pos": [65.70741271972656, 297.5516662597656], "widgets_values": ["A high-end commercial product poster for Space One Pro headphones featuring a premium off-white over-ear headset suspended in a soft cream gradient void, designed with a sophisticated minimalist aesthetic and a color palette dominated by warm beige, champagne gold, and blush pink. The central subject is a meticulously rendered 3D model of the headphones with smooth matte ear cushions, polished metallic headbands, and a sleek ergonomic design that emphasizes premium materials and tactile elegance. Surrounding the floating device are abstract, flowing ribbons of translucent pink silk fabric cascading from the left and a scattering of glossy pearl spheres in varying sizes that add depth and a sense of ethereal luxury to the composition. The background utilizes a soft, painterly cream-to-gold gradient that creates a serene and uncluttered canvas for the product, while typography elements for Space One Pro and Pure Silence are integrated with elegant serif fonts in deep chocolate brown, arranged in a balanced vertical hierarchy with generous negative space. Lighting is rendered as soft, directional studio illumination creating gentle highlights on the metallic accents and soft shadows beneath the headphones to enhance three-dimensionality, accented by subtle volumetric glows and lens flare effects that lend a dreamy, high-quality finish, culminating in an atmosphere of quiet luxury, pure sophistication, and refined auditory silence."], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 76, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 62, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 14}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"name": "image", "links": [104, 106], "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}], "size": [322.8977966308594, 121.57750701904297], "color": "rgba(27, 89, 123, 0.7)", "pos": [2216.291015625, 63.05419921875], "widgets_values": [0.9000000000000001, 1.2000000000000002, 0.8000000000000002], "inputs": [{"name": "image", "link": 37, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "brightness"}, "name": "brightness", "label": "brightness", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "brightness"}, {"widget": {"name": "contrast"}, "name": "contrast", "label": "contrast", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "contrast"}, {"widget": {"name": "saturation"}, "name": "saturation", "label": "saturation", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "saturation"}], "flags": {}, "id": 29, "type": "LayerColor: BrightnessContrastV2", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for 